    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "textbook-definition",
        "moduleId": "platform-definition",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材定义：运行在 .NET 平台上的 Python 实现",
        "markdown": "IronPython 是**运行在 .NET 平台上的 Python 实现**。它让 Python 程序在 .NET 运行时中执行，因此属于 Python 语言的众多实现之一，而不是另一门新语言。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-02a2660bfbda114ce9f016b3",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000157"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "迈出下一步",
                "IronPython"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1315,
              "lineEnd": 1329,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "2f835aabbc9dbb8f5c4731702ed875e31e657d19cb51a54e2b8d8e88aa2edd76"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-language-vs-implementation",
        "moduleId": "platform-definition",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：把语言与实现分开看",
        "markdown": "理解 IronPython 的关键，是把 **Python 语言**与**运行它的软件**分开看：语言规定语法和语义，实现负责真正执行代码。CPython 用 C 实现，是教材一直在使用的经典解释器；IronPython 则是面向 .NET 平台的实现。两者执行同一门语言，但依托的运行环境和可用的库生态不同。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-definition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-interop",
        "moduleId": "interop-mechanism",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "教材要点：与 .NET 的双向互操作",
        "markdown": "教材强调 IronPython 与 .NET 的**双向可用**：在 Python 语言中可以调用 .NET 的库与类，反过来也可以让 .NET 代码使用 Python 的类与库。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-02a2660bfbda114ce9f016b3",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000157"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "迈出下一步",
                "IronPython"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1315,
              "lineEnd": 1329,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "2f835aabbc9dbb8f5c4731702ed875e31e657d19cb51a54e2b8d8e88aa2edd76"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-interop-scenario",
        "moduleId": "interop-mechanism",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "模型补充：一个互操作情境",
        "markdown": "假设一个团队已有用 .NET 编写的业务组件，又希望用 Python 编写自动化脚本和扩展逻辑。IronPython 可以直接使用这些 .NET 类库，脚本与原有组件处在同一运行平台，因此不必把全部脚本改写成 C#。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-interop"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-implementation-table",
        "moduleId": "implementation-comparison",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "table",
        "title": "教材对照：不同 Python 实现",
        "markdown": "| 实现 | 依托的平台或实现方式 |\n|---|---|\n| CPython | 使用 C 语言编写的经典 Python 解释器 |\n| Jython | 运行在 Java 平台上 |\n| IronPython | 运行在 .NET 平台上 |\n| PyPy | 用 Python 编写的 Python 实现 |",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-02a2660bfbda114ce9f016b3",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000157"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "迈出下一步",
                "IronPython"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1315,
              "lineEnd": 1329,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "2f835aabbc9dbb8f5c4731702ed875e31e657d19cb51a54e2b8d8e88aa2edd76"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-comparison-dimensions",
        "moduleId": "implementation-comparison",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "模型补充：比较实现时看什么",
        "markdown": "比较这些实现时，统一的维度是**目标运行平台**和**需要复用的既有库**。需要进入 Java 生态时选 Jython，需要 .NET 生态时选 IronPython；没有特殊平台约束时，教材所讲的 CPython 仍是默认起点。只比较名称或版本号并不能说明哪一种实现更适合当前项目。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-implementation-table"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-specialized-domains",
        "moduleId": "fit-and-boundary",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "教材提醒：每种实现都有专门领域",
        "markdown": "教材在列举这些实现后指出：上述每一种实现都有其大有作为的专门领域。也就是说，选择实现取决于目标任务，不能简单地认为某一种实现全面优于其他实现。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-02a2660bfbda114ce9f016b3",
